          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Serious Mass delivers about 1,250 calories and 50 g of protein per full serving, mostly from carbohydrate. Pro Gainer delivers about 650 calories and 60 g of protein, so a much larger share of its calories comes from protein. Serious Mass suits hardgainers; Pro Gainer suits a leaner, controlled bulk."
          }
