          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Optimum Nutrition protein safe?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "ON is a long-established brand, and its core whey is widely promoted as Informed Choice certified for banned substances. As with any supplement, choose authentic stock from reputable sellers. Pregnant people, those with kidney disease and anyone on medication should check with a doctor or registered dietitian before using protein supplements."
