              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Serious Mass gets only about a sixth of its calories from protein and delivers around 1,250 calories per full serving. For a controlled surplus, Pro Gainer or a homemade shake built on Gold Standard whey gives far more protein per calorie and much better control over your intake.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Assuming every ON product is sport-certified</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Certification is product and flavor specific. Gold Standard whey is widely promoted as Informed Choice certified, but that does not automatically extend to every tub. Tested athletes should look up the exact product in the Informed Sport or NSF Certified for Sport database before using it.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
