              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Buying from unknown marketplace sellers</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Popular brands attract counterfeits and old stock. Buy from the brand's storefront or listings sold by a major retailer, and check the seal, lot number and best-by date on arrival. A small saving is not worth uncertainty about what is actually in the tub.
